              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Feline leukemia virus (FeLV), feline administered as needed to normalize serum immunodeficiency virus (FIV), mycoplasma, iron and transferrin saturation before initiating or rickettsial testing to exclude infectionand during EPO treatment; injectable iron induced myelodyscrasia. more effective than oral preparations.",
              "pdf_page": 162,
              "printed_page": 80,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Serum EPO—inappropriately normal or",
